'''Fuling Berserkers''' are aggressive [[creatures]] found in [[Plains]] guarding [[Fuling Village|Fuling Villages]] and [[Stonehenge|Stonehenges]]. They are large, strong goblin-like beings that appear to possess their own tribalistic culture. It is implied through [[Runestone|runestones]] and [[Fuling Totem|totems]] that they worship [[Yagluth]], a long dead king.

