== Attacks and abilities ==
{{For|strategies for defeating Fuling berserkers|Aggressive creature strategies#Fuling berserker}}

=== Attack ===
Swings their club in a 4-meter 70-degree arc in front of themselves (130 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 40 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). This attack can be used within 3 meters of the player every 2 seconds. It has two variations: a regular swing and delayed swing<ref>The timing difference between the regular swing and the delayed swing is approximately 0.297 seconds.</ref>.

=== Rage attack ===
Slams their club into the ground 3 times extending out 4 meters and arcing 60 degrees vertically, stepping forward with each swing (130 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 100 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 40 Tier 2 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage each). They can do this every 20 seconds when within 6 meters of a player.

